stateDiagram-v2
    %% Canonical Deal State Machine from Phase9Requirements.cs

    [*] --> initiated

    initiated --> contacted : CRM Outreach
    initiated --> negotiating : Direct Offer Received
    initiated --> withdrawn : Proposer Retracts

    contacted --> interested : Counterparty Responds
    contacted --> rejected : Not a Fit
    contacted --> withdrawn : Retracted

    interested --> meeting_scheduled : Pitch / Meeting Booked
    interested --> due_diligence : Direct Room Request
    interested --> rejected : Evaluated & Declined
    interested --> withdrawn : Retracted

    meeting_scheduled --> due_diligence : Meeting Held / Diligence Starts
    meeting_scheduled --> negotiating : Immediate Term Discussion
    meeting_scheduled --> rejected : Declined Post-Meeting
    meeting_scheduled --> withdrawn : Retracted

    due_diligence --> negotiating : Data Room Audit Passed
    due_diligence --> rejected : Diligence Red Flag
    due_diligence --> withdrawn : Retracted

    negotiating --> term_sheet : Live Term Sheet Drafted
    negotiating --> agreement_sent : Terms Accepted Directly
    negotiating --> rejected : Negotiation Breaks Down
    negotiating --> withdrawn : Walkaway

    term_sheet --> agreement_sent : Terms Formally Accepted
    term_sheet --> negotiating : Counter-Offer Submitted
    term_sheet --> rejected : Offer Expired/Rejected
    term_sheet --> withdrawn : Walkaway

    agreement_sent --> signed : Both Signatures Persisted
    agreement_sent --> rejected : Signature Refused
    agreement_sent --> withdrawn : Walkaway

    signed --> completed : Founder Closes Deal (Payment / Funds Confirmed)

    completed --> [*] : Terminal (Advances Company Phase & Creates Holdings)
    rejected --> [*] : Terminal (Deal Abandoned)
    withdrawn --> [*] : Terminal (Offer Rescinded)
